{"events": [{"tStartMs": 0, "dDurationMs": 2820, "segs": [{"utf8": "- In 1887, a young\nphysics teacher attached"}]}, {"tStartMs": 2820, "dDurationMs": 2430, "segs": [{"utf8": "a thin glass rod to the end of an arrow"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5250, "dDurationMs": 2460, "segs": [{"utf8": "and loaded it into his homemade crossbow."}]}, {"tStartMs": 7710, "dDurationMs": 2730, "segs": [{"utf8": "He torched the rod's end\nuntil a molten glass bead."}]}, {"tStartMs": 10440, "dDurationMs": 1620, "segs": [{"utf8": "Roughly the size of a pin's head,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 12060, "dDurationMs": 1620, "segs": [{"utf8": "it was barely hanging on."}]}, {"tStartMs": 13680, "dDurationMs": 2055, "segs": [{"utf8": "And then he fired the arrow."}]}, {"tStartMs": 15735, "dDurationMs": 2261, "segs": [{"utf8": "(air whooshing)"}]}, {"tStartMs": 17996, "dDurationMs": 3083, "segs": [{"utf8": "(suspenseful music)"}]}, {"tStartMs": 23610, "dDurationMs": 1680, "segs": [{"utf8": "Bright sunlight streaming into the room"}]}, {"tStartMs": 25290, "dDurationMs": 2940, "segs": [{"utf8": "glinted off a tiny glass fiber."}]}, {"tStartMs": 28230, "dDurationMs": 1830, "segs": [{"utf8": "At its thinnest, it was less than a tenth"}]}, {"tStartMs": 30060, "dDurationMs": 2430, "segs": [{"utf8": "of the diameter of a human hair."}]}, {"tStartMs": 32490, "dDurationMs": 3690, "segs": [{"utf8": "Now legally we cannot\nshoot a crossbow indoors."}]}, {"tStartMs": 36180, "dDurationMs": 1521, "segs": [{"utf8": "Luckily I am pretty quick."}]}, {"tStartMs": 37701, "dDurationMs": 1646, "segs": [{"utf8": "(Henry chuckles)"}]}, {"tStartMs": 39347, "dDurationMs": 3083, "segs": [{"utf8": "(suspenseful music)"}]}, {"tStartMs": 46141, "dDurationMs": 1212, "segs": [{"utf8": "That is cool."}]}, {"tStartMs": 47353, "dDurationMs": 833, "segs": [{"utf8": "Look at that."}]}, {"tStartMs": 48186, "dDurationMs": 1644, "segs": [{"utf8": "Look how thin we got it."}]}, {"tStartMs": 49830, "dDurationMs": 1800, "segs": [{"utf8": "The physics teacher was using these fibers"}]}, {"tStartMs": 51630, "dDurationMs": 1650, "segs": [{"utf8": "to measure very small forces,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 53280, "dDurationMs": 1410, "segs": [{"utf8": "but in the decades that followed,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 54690, "dDurationMs": 2910, "segs": [{"utf8": "other researchers found\na different use for them:"}]}, {"tStartMs": 57600, "dDurationMs": 1560, "segs": [{"utf8": "sending light signals."}]}, {"tStartMs": 59160, "dDurationMs": 833, "segs": [{"utf8": "(quiet dramatic music)"}]}, {"tStartMs": 59993, "dDurationMs": 2467, "segs": [{"utf8": "Glass fibers can carry\nlight even through bends."}]}, {"tStartMs": 62460, "dDurationMs": 2130, "segs": [{"utf8": "Look at it. It's like that's 90 degrees."}]}, {"tStartMs": 64590, "dDurationMs": 1470, "segs": [{"utf8": "And during the 1960s,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 66060, "dDurationMs": 1650, "segs": [{"utf8": "the telecoms industry was desperate"}]}, {"tStartMs": 67710, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "for a better way to\ncarry more information."}]}, {"tStartMs": 70110, "dDurationMs": 1807, "segs": [{"utf8": "As one American engineer said,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 71917, "dDurationMs": 2190, "segs": [{"utf8": "\"It should be possible to transmit"}]}, {"tStartMs": 74107, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "\"all of the conversations going on"}]}, {"tStartMs": 76027, "dDurationMs": 2490, "segs": [{"utf8": "\"anywhere in the world simultaneously"}]}, {"tStartMs": 78517, "dDurationMs": 2963, "segs": [{"utf8": "\"over a single thread of light.\""}]}, {"tStartMs": 81480, "dDurationMs": 2730, "segs": [{"utf8": "But these glass fibers were terrible."}]}, {"tStartMs": 84210, "dDurationMs": 2670, "segs": [{"utf8": "The light faded so much that\nyou couldn't decode a signal"}]}, {"tStartMs": 86880, "dDurationMs": 2010, "segs": [{"utf8": "after just one kilometer."}]}, {"tStartMs": 88890, "dDurationMs": 1980, "segs": [{"utf8": "No one thought they'd be practical."}]}]}